OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in 60s dies after being hit
OL,4,Aby Range Rover
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died after being hit by a
OL,7,FRange Rover.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to Mare
OL,10,FClose in the village of Seghill,
OL,11,FNorthumberland, on Sunday afternoon.
OL,12,FNorthumbria Police said a grey Range
OL,13,FRover Sport had collided with a
OL,14,Fpedestrian, a woman in her 60s, near an
OL,15,Fentrance gate to a field.
OL,17,FShe sustained life-threatening injuries
OL,18,Fand died in hospital on Sunday evening.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
