OL,4,Aby Range Rover
OL,5,
OL,6,FSgt Greg Huntley of Northumbria Police
OL,7,Fsaid officers' thoughts were with the
OL,8,Ffamily and appealed for anyone with
OL,9,Fdashcam footage to come forward.
